{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000330", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1608, "line_end": 1608, "char_start": 106303, "char_end": 106358, "block_index": 329}, "text": "Stage 5 Audit: Energy Governance & Resource Allocation", "sha256": "eceaa7f766c2f42f7e2561a2e1f7e54e4664dd4921149ea8c9fe3754919e0225", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000332", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1612, "line_end": 1612, "char_start": 106629, "char_end": 106736, "block_index": 331}, "text": "In your system, \"Energy\" isn't just electricity; it is Attention, Computing Power, and Strategic Momentum.", "sha256": "29051b6cd292d4b1a0c361683bfcd828dc3d49dfa1196b5c4d2aa4f02042930e", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000333", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1614, "line_end": 1614, "char_start": 106737, "char_end": 106773, "block_index": 332}, "text": "1. The \"Token Economy\" of Attention", "sha256": "0fc937fb3f7e8e2b13e454d2f185d748edd5922a462763e0d8f9752e3ffb234d", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000334", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1616, "line_end": 1616, "char_start": 106774, "char_end": 106968, "block_index": 333}, "text": "You mentioned that every tap and decision is an actionable event. However, every AI call (Gemini, Claude, Perplexity) has a \"cost\" in terms of tokens, time, and cognitive load for the operator.", "sha256": "0ff1310cce21f0d4e4e1f132dadbe01063e553f33c491f81d666e2bc75398e89", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000335", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.95, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1618, "line_end": 1618, "char_start": 106969, "char_end": 107114, "block_index": 334}, "text": "The Audit: How does the system prioritize which drones get the \"High-Energy\" models (the Opus or Ultra versions) versus the \"Low-Energy\" models?", "sha256": "63b92c815f805757a994ac031756aa5e4b7caab64a74d00d6b56de692d633cf9", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000336", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1620, "line_end": 1620, "char_start": 107115, "char_end": 107368, "block_index": 335}, "text": "The Challenge: Is there a Hierarchical Energy Gate? For example, does a drone start with a \"Low-Energy\" scout model to find the pheromone trail, and only \"tap into\" the high-energy Architect model once a \"Protein Source\" (high-value lead) is confirmed?", "sha256": "4ceb22b10ad09890a5b5b8d8bbd8c3d1cea1fe53292766a65e93151bba63071d", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000338", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1624, "line_end": 1624, "char_start": 107420, "char_end": 107618, "block_index": 337}, "text": "\"Energy Governance\" is one of your four core protocols. If we compare this to Rome, the roads (infrastructure) were only useful if there were enough horses and messengers (energy) to traverse them.", "sha256": "5b7abe6d73e66ca469251c304447a71cf2f9d3b1dbd18959627e31992f0a31ac", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000339", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.95, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1626, "line_end": 1626, "char_start": 107619, "char_end": 107692, "block_index": 338}, "text": "The Audit: How do we govern the Sustained Momentum of the 10,000 drones?", "sha256": "53d1caf2ce2c8fcf67b6b8e5de420f03601d67734bceaf4509fe1c1d6d8cd13c", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000340", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1628, "line_end": 1628, "char_start": 107693, "char_end": 107938, "block_index": 339}, "text": "The Challenge: If you have 10,000 drones running simultaneously, you could hit \"API Exhaustion\" or \"Contextual Burnout\" within hours. What is the Energy Dampener that prevents the system from \"overheating\" when it hits a high-chaos environment?", "sha256": "33afbd731ab1a17bb25af8681d99bd31c9e7ef8823e6d232d0ebd7cd4f6b0aad", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000341", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1630, "line_end": 1630, "char_start": 107939, "char_end": 107974, "block_index": 340}, "text": "3. The Operator as the Power Plant", "sha256": "ad8cfef393a01b8c941a84dd0e60d98522e716ddd3b62a474a10f84075c1d19e", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000342", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1632, "line_end": 1632, "char_start": 107975, "char_end": 108036, "block_index": 341}, "text": "You are the source of the \"DNA.\" But the operator is finite.", "sha256": "0fa3f1b9ce69a52230f7c7db3118babd8cb19f2d0f499daf41098ea9f544345b", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000343", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1634, "line_end": 1634, "char_start": 108037, "char_end": 108179, "block_index": 342}, "text": "The Audit: Your strategy involves recording classes and high school sessions to feed the system. This is a form of Passive Energy Harvesting.", "sha256": "faca9b3c6411b44e830b23bf9da33638c7419b7cc0235b34983fc8e50126ab01", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000344", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1636, "line_end": 1636, "char_start": 108180, "char_end": 108458, "block_index": 343}, "text": "The Challenge: How do we ensure the drones don't demand more \"Energy\" (corrections/input) from you than you can provide? Is there a \"Battery Save Mode\" where drones can operate autonomously on \"low-fidelity\" for 72 hours without needing a refresh from your legal/strategic DNA?", "sha256": "04da8572264a6a048d952437f359667c6c1195d7a030aaf1c6e5e79544fc9306", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000345", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1638, "line_end": 1638, "char_start": 108459, "char_end": 108507, "block_index": 344}, "text": "4. Energy Recovery (The Audit the Auditor Loop)", "sha256": "0866cc9d36710245c3b3cdf9253e4cce57a37867b1136889305b388a5b175cda", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000346", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1640, "line_end": 1640, "char_start": 108508, "char_end": 108607, "block_index": 345}, "text": "In the \"Audit the Auditor\" process, energy is recovered by consolidating \"noise\" into \"knowledge.\"", "sha256": "22e0c807928440e632fbc5cc20319b3588813e21b87523fce0bea3c2e84a4b58", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000347", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1642, "line_end": 1642, "char_start": 108608, "char_end": 108709, "block_index": 346}, "text": "The Audit: Every time you consolidate 40 documents into 10 in a Space, you are Concentrating Energy.", "sha256": "9d7d727cdfa526d59f0877136f9e8bdeeb4c1ff22486712ad1c5c4a70cf0aca8", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000348", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1644, "line_end": 1644, "char_start": 108710, "char_end": 109041, "block_index": 347}, "text": "The Challenge: In Stage 5, we need to define the Recycle Loop. When a drone project fails (as discussed in Stage 4), how is that \"lost energy\" recovered and turned into \"potential energy\" for the next project? Does the failure log immediately update the \"100 Layers\" to ensure no future drone wastes \"fuel\" on that specific error?", "sha256": "5d10d50c738b4fb86fedd49534259dfdfab20e3475c06ec9736bb0a4742b09c6", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000349", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1646, "line_end": 1646, "char_start": 109042, "char_end": 109210, "block_index": 348}, "text": "Do we need to refine the \"Token Budgeting\" for the 100 Navy Seal Teams, or are you ready for Stage 6 to audit \"Rome\" (The Infrastructure & The Roads of the Ecosystem)?", "sha256": "e24d44d20730d05a263b1eee558ccea999bb5159d19f2a31045a450d322c51ba", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000350", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1654, "line_end": 1654, "char_start": 109217, "char_end": 109225, "block_index": 349}, "text": "Stage 6", "sha256": "d921dcecfc2ac958768d3d7f57f62f55b501bf62139900f8a3a4cfde3f944d37", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000351", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1666, "line_end": 1666, "char_start": 109236, "char_end": 109291, "block_index": 350}, "text": "Stage 6 Audit: Rome & The Road System (Infrastructure)", "sha256": "1c54d9fe3918eb81aa6111ac2cf7995f47483015073faa77e45756f55e151774", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000353", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1670, "line_end": 1670, "char_start": 109580, "char_end": 109671, "block_index": 352}, "text": "Rome wasn't just a city; it was a Network of roads so reliable that \"all roads led to it.\"", "sha256": "801b58c25c0ce1a32076abd941dfa0c08fe6d72d3b5261506de9fc31d66f9b87", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000354", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1672, "line_end": 1672, "char_start": 109672, "char_end": 109709, "block_index": 353}, "text": "1. The API \"Highways\" (Connectivity)", "sha256": "0c49dd505733a32b9b2e5eb66f61410e85448f6d6cae18b7d06ed7f55769b86d", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000356", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1676, "line_end": 1676, "char_start": 109820, "char_end": 109949, "block_index": 355}, "text": "The Audit: If a drone is switching between Gemini, Claude, and Perplexity, it is essentially jumping between different \"cities.\"", "sha256": "551492d1ad5f230aa1db46e69a4ebe1e81f8e52c728a6f08e5fff1962b632e20", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000357", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1678, "line_end": 1678, "char_start": 109950, "char_end": 110292, "block_index": 356}, "text": "The Challenge: How do we ensure the Standardization of the Payload? If Gemini (the Architect) provides a blueprint in one format, and Claude (the Auditor) expects another, the \"road\" is broken. Do we have a Translation Layer in the infrastructure that converts all model outputs into a \"Universal Rome Format\" before they hit the next drone?", "sha256": "0e7fb39dd7d4b57bc90211ac2e9027dd5a62153d4a71cc69a0300bdda8659485", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000359", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1682, "line_end": 1682, "char_start": 110335, "char_end": 110428, "block_index": 358}, "text": "Roman cities were famous for their grid layouts—predictable, scalable, and easy to navigate.", "sha256": "297a73994f3e5c426e81354187b9a15a39de84f260c08b700bb16a26deaf70f6", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000360", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1684, "line_end": 1684, "char_start": 110429, "char_end": 110476, "block_index": 359}, "text": "The Audit: You are creating a \"100-layer map.\"", "sha256": "0df41d8379cfbdb4ecdf297536ea7b707ff7bfe756d3553bfbd1edb7f580e99a", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000361", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1686, "line_end": 1686, "char_start": 110477, "char_end": 110868, "block_index": 360}, "text": "The Challenge: Is this map a Living Document hosted in a centralized \"Command Station\" (like the Phoenix project), or is it decentralized across the drones? If a drone in Team 50 discovers a better way to audit a JavaScript file, how does that \"Infrastructure Update\" propagate to Team 1 instantly? We need to define the \"Master Grid\" that synchronizes all \"Desire Paths\" found by the ants.", "sha256": "a891a5403f2694973bc339cc4adfc94a60aa264abc246f0aec4843aa2c0cad81", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000362", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1688, "line_end": 1688, "char_start": 110869, "char_end": 110900, "block_index": 361}, "text": "3. The \"Aqueducts\" (Data Flow)", "sha256": "84ed6f2a4c241e2deb5032697a6ca85b85ee183ffaa220111847785f51e74bb2", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000363", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1690, "line_end": 1690, "char_start": 110901, "char_end": 111013, "block_index": 362}, "text": "Roman aqueducts moved massive amounts of water (energy/data) with zero electricity, using only gravity (logic).", "sha256": "549d8b43002789a12b4606c192405c080de3c74cb501b0c2fdd745a8aa8b0048", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000365", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1694, "line_end": 1694, "char_start": 111111, "char_end": 111383, "block_index": 364}, "text": "The Challenge: Once those 10 foundational documents are ready, how are they \"piped\" to the 10,000 drones? Are we using a Vector Database (the digital aqueduct) where drones can \"query\" the foundation in real-time without you having to manually upload files to every chat?", "sha256": "4c2a5440ff342858ad4c60dadf8ad7242933662970a24cd2087f8831c5a1bb31", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000366", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1696, "line_end": 1696, "char_start": 111384, "char_end": 111435, "block_index": 365}, "text": "4. Maintenance & The \"Praetorian Guard\" (Security)", "sha256": "c1bec55407455bb9253afad8d6d91236f71f49e245c54f26a21c0fcd1e4fb44d", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000367", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1698, "line_end": 1698, "char_start": 111436, "char_end": 111491, "block_index": 366}, "text": "The roads of Rome were only safe if they were guarded.", "sha256": "716272195c9bb9273bb9f7c065df2a4dc1c36275457502fe1e85e8973bbd07cd", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000368", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1700, "line_end": 1700, "char_start": 111492, "char_end": 111647, "block_index": 367}, "text": "The Audit: With thousands of drones carrying your \"Authority,\" they are high-value targets for digital \"highwaymen\" (hackers, scrapers, or competitor AI).", "sha256": "8015e69032e14f59b1be827767ff64ea19a3a6449d36ca5e7625499a23356dc2", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000369", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1702, "line_end": 1702, "char_start": 111648, "char_end": 111937, "block_index": 368}, "text": "The Challenge: What is the \"Infrastructure Security\"? If one drone is \"captured\" or compromised by a malicious client during a \"risk-free\" trial, can it lead the attacker back to the Immutable Root? Do we have \"Gatehouses\" between the front-end Net Ecosystem and the back-end Data Vaults?", "sha256": "7d9ab616823f55275ec3c15faa750f425cc6694f706b8321f6e786b8d531a5a6", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000370", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1704, "line_end": 1704, "char_start": 111938, "char_end": 112110, "block_index": 369}, "text": "Do we need to harden the \"API Highways\" for these 100 Navy Seal Teams, or are you ready for Stage 7 to audit \"The 100 Layers\" (The Strategy & The Blueprint for the Swarm)?", "sha256": "3cb5f30b63559db30384f1a6cb6003c94c19e6cee03b3792d99cd1704eb3006b", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000371", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.95, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1712, "line_end": 1712, "char_start": 112117, "char_end": 112119, "block_index": 370}, "text": "7", "sha256": "7902699be42c8a8e46fbbb4501726517e86b22c56a189f7625a6da49081b2451", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000372", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1724, "line_end": 1724, "char_start": 112130, "char_end": 112183, "block_index": 371}, "text": "Stage 7 Audit: The 100 Layers & The Master Blueprint", "sha256": "a89db20416245b7058eed9680277e1088e8de5061079efae4dcb191e44c3c1eb", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000373", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1726, "line_end": 1726, "char_start": 112184, "char_end": 112491, "block_index": 372}, "text": "We have the roads of Rome; now we audit the Blueprint that travels upon them. You mentioned creating the \"first hundred layers\" that the drones will follow. In this system, these layers aren't just a to-do list—they are the Architectural Map that the Navy Seal Teams use to execute \"lightning-fast\" builds.", "sha256": "ddb51842b80c937db1ed82d71bc0b016a416af0b529c5d61f1139804d3e770f7", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000374", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1728, "line_end": 1728, "char_start": 112492, "char_end": 112527, "block_index": 373}, "text": "1. The Hierarchy of the 100 Layers", "sha256": "705de52ff80b615ef301a3018a412b01af458187ed578348cda121ff3e62fb6f", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000375", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1730, "line_end": 1730, "char_start": 112528, "char_end": 112641, "block_index": 374}, "text": "If the drones are to operate autonomously for hours, the 100 layers must be structured to prevent \"logic loops.\"", "sha256": "c9dc9c03973349e170ff7245b6f67656d8d3eed4b93460c94d0268ef486b1990", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000376", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.95, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1732, "line_end": 1732, "char_start": 112642, "char_end": 112691, "block_index": 375}, "text": "The Audit: How are these 100 layers categorized?", "sha256": "120b456eef87b63d30502ffd24b4e9221e3ca4616744c675ede7146646393fc6", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000378", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1736, "line_end": 1736, "char_start": 113056, "char_end": 113100, "block_index": 377}, "text": "2. The \"Actionable Event\" as a Layer Update", "sha256": "07a1353d42c84443e88d386febba5c11092bd5a7f8a6224d512342f1810387ef", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
