{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000591", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2714, "line_end": 2714, "char_start": 163092, "char_end": 163369, "block_index": 590}, "text": "There was one AI that says something I'd like for you to like try to work at it. He said the clouds of this is like you're you're you're he got explained it like you're not um simulating you're you're augmenting reality. Can you try to try to connect and say why he said that?", "sha256": "cfd184c1c456d2432177cda30d3aad323b6d2df599f47c10323f1823859ab9af", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000593", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.95, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2732, "line_end": 2732, "char_start": 163665, "char_end": 163734, "block_index": 592}, "text": "Um how could augmentation connect in with the whole idea of mapping?", "sha256": "88fb9cad0559cf2312116a93749aba8170279a56bd900e65f983526289aa3958", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000597", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2768, "line_end": 2768, "char_start": 164642, "char_end": 165016, "block_index": 596}, "text": "What was that thing called in that Star Wars? That weird thing that would like go uh I'm going to I was going to try to make the noise, but I realized this is speech to text, but it's like this robot thing that floats around and makes it like a robot noise and it like is a scout for the empire. Uh it appears in the uh the episode that has like the snowy tundra and stuff.", "sha256": "32076cc7916c82777ccb4f69ade946b0e8c29356dde826d45b54a84d3d6d99a6", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000598", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2778, "line_end": 2778, "char_start": 165025, "char_end": 165220, "block_index": 597}, "text": "Ah, you're probably thinking of the Probe Droid. They're distinctive floating robots used by the Empire to scout and map territories, like the snowy tundra in Episode V: The Empire Strikes Back.", "sha256": "bb52cf1455423f808fad99ef89c9bffaae75852b77c2ea18b1590f33e2c987c1", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000605", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2840, "line_end": 2840, "char_start": 167117, "char_end": 167305, "block_index": 604}, "text": "So that would be a good like ledger command set build in is one of Anakin's kind of first commands is to take charge of things like that because that's that would be his bread and butter.", "sha256": "914e94bb8c752846932ca28ab7dbfdd6f645efa980def01724ecbdfd59b85f98", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000607", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2858, "line_end": 2858, "char_start": 167592, "char_end": 167843, "block_index": 606}, "text": "So like how many times did Anakin um pay the ultimate price for some of his decisions? I mean he obviously did but like in the moments where he was saving the uh Republic's uh skin time after time um how often did his chaotic actions lead to success?", "sha256": "bd8c2c6b9941c38b9f4d6c64ca1530eedfc0d3fc22a853ad04fd3e115bf7dcf5", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
