{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000611", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2894, "line_end": 2894, "char_start": 168705, "char_end": 168806, "block_index": 610}, "text": "Yeah, and and our Lord just make sure that Anakin doesn't kill any uh, you know, younglings, please.", "sha256": "4673f3279f95f87bca21ed6545b6b1d5c4c2fc1464f07495984e22a4cba8f4cd", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000617", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2948, "line_end": 2948, "char_start": 170687, "char_end": 170831, "block_index": 616}, "text": "But these uh these uh probe droids can also like actually uh watch uh real world things that are happening, gather data that way, can they not?", "sha256": "024a1154fadfcfdb4b45bbd1c404358bd31e189a0eaf34de1318c55837089095", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000625", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3024, "line_end": 3024, "char_start": 173453, "char_end": 173834, "block_index": 624}, "text": "Yeah, imagine the system um relying on just its hands feeling around and then I'm talking back to um you know someone who can see but it can just describe what it like what it looks like so they can feel around right? But why don't we just give the the the hands like um eyes directly that connects and give the AI like a real time um boots on the ground view of the surroundings.", "sha256": "26db956311171a2d2f914e82f18be1117d051a142ef3286086e555778213e312", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000627", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3042, "line_end": 3042, "char_start": 174200, "char_end": 174945, "block_index": 626}, "text": "What could AI do with a team of, let's say we send out um uh a team of like 10 drones like one one drone has their 99 internal pieces assigned to, you know, the marketing team and um one assigned to the social media. You know, you know, you what I'm like everything is covered kind of covered and they come um but first they they are in like probe droid mode and they're just there to gather data and simulate out things while like watching and uh how how much data in just one hour could these 10 uh drones like uh through the process using APIs, auditing through Grock, through um through Sonar, through Claude, through GPT, uh all optimally switching between for each of the the pieces of data that's gathered. What could be done in an hour?", "sha256": "9f79267f0d2c1747d2d988f08571655806c20354e072c84d0e8273fa153115b4", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000629", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3060, "line_end": 3060, "char_start": 175448, "char_end": 175856, "block_index": 628}, "text": "So, just grab what that would be like. It would be like a Navy team six, you know, um hitting the ground without their advanced equipment that allows them to see in the dark and give them all those like things that they have that makes gives them that edge, right? It's like um it's it's allowing us to hit the ground um in not unknown territory, but in a place that we know um uh like the back of our hand.", "sha256": "17e5c61b5008a72ce91d39fabe270c2577094ca42bb28fbd7b41b9bc43d306d2", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000633", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.55, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3096, "line_end": 3096, "char_start": 177292, "char_end": 177927, "block_index": 632}, "text": "Well, the the the main node is like always check the sub nodes, the paddle ones work. They have they have three paddle ones under them unless they need more for a certain type of mission. So, uh the team sizes can increase. Um but uh the the node is like uh constantly um you know, checking uh like what what is this like what does a successful um what does a successful result look like? Uh do we have that already? Is it a ledger? Yeah, yes, a ledger. No, this is new territory. Okay, looking at procedure um in new territory. Okay, no contact. Like blah blah blah, right? It's just like it's just um yeah. It's going to be awesome.", "sha256": "2a068dc6473457e7f41f6f75cf9f027ae9f340de5ebb248c776549cddbf25690", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000637", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3132, "line_end": 3132, "char_start": 179611, "char_end": 179632, "block_index": 636}, "text": "Hi, can you hear me?", "sha256": "9116458da6a0ce8a2673c12c7c343ed7ca52e8dfcca817f1b9f36b8b007a9a5a", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
