{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000639", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3152, "line_end": 3152, "char_start": 179707, "char_end": 180203, "block_index": 638}, "text": "Okay. All right. So, um I want to um we'll we'll do some auditing in the chat there and consolidating of this information, but I want you to start like um you can do as many stages as you want. This is a huge conversation we've just had, so we'll just keep uh every time I say um next, you'll do the most you can to consolidate and organize this information. Like we want it to be uh digestible, right? So, I want you to kind of like brainstorm uh 10 ideas. Tell me 10 ideas you have to do that.", "sha256": "e691509cfded2de76fe3f2a01f81a6adbbeed8629df3ae236913ae9378241878", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000643", "label": "user", "confidence": 0.8500000000000001, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3188, "line_end": 3188, "char_start": 182187, "char_end": 182538, "block_index": 642}, "text": "Yeah, and this is how the AI will like uh um you know, talk with each other uh optimized uh and and continue to be more optimized for, you know, um the free models and for, you know, um keeping the overhead as low as possible, but maximizing our access to um, you know, a powerful enough systems to uh move these uh system forward at the proper pace.", "sha256": "f7c62f03db4a4aed32364e308d898fa4016ae48740e4339ae58a57a7103b7b76", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
